      <title>财政部向八家金融央企增资3600亿元：资产负债表质量下降的信号</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260906/%E8%B4%A2%E6%94%BF%E9%83%A8%E5%90%91%E5%85%AB%E5%AE%B6%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E5%A4%AE%E4%BC%81%E5%A2%9E%E8%B5%843600%E4%BA%BF%E5%85%83%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%A7%E8%B4%9F%E5%80%BA%E8%A1%A8%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7/</link>
